        "id": 1052399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-01T00:53:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not allow users to suppress the unused libraries even in checkbuilds?\nThe feature is not disabled. The codegen_only is an optional property.",
